              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yosiya aha abantu bose bari ngaho imyagazi y’intama n’iy’ impene yo mu mikuku, yo kuba ibimazi vya Pasika; igitigiri c’iyo myagazi car’ ibihumbi mirongwitatu; abaha n’amapfizi ibihumbi bitatu; ivyo vyose ni vyo umwami yatanze kw itunga ryiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.34.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 34:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.34.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abaganwa biwe na bo nyene nk’uko bavyigombeye baha abantu ibimazi vyo gutanga, babiha n’abaherezi n’Abalewi. Hilukiya na Zekariya na Yehiyeli, abakuru baganza ivy’ ingoro y’Imana, baha abaherezi ivyo gutanga kw ibimazi vya Pasika, imyagazi ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atandatu, n’amapfizi amajana atatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’ abakuru b’Abalewi, Konaniya na barumuna biwe Shemaya na Netaneli, bo na Hashabiya na Yeyeli na Yozabadi, baha Abalewi ivyo gutanga kw ibimazi vya Pasika, imyagazi ibihumbi bitanu n’amapfizi amajana atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 30:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.18"
