            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 6:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bakerera imyagazi ya Pasika, abaherezi bamija amaraso bayahawe n’abo Balewi, Abalewi na bo baraheza barabāga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūrah’ imitigiri yo kuba ibimazi vyo kwoswa, bayiha abantu nk’ukw amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, kugira ngo na bo bayīhēre Uhoraho kw ibimazi, nk’ uko vyanditswe mu gitabo ca Mose. N’ayo mapfizi na yo bayagenza bartyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
